  "statuteText": "125-F:8-b Radiation User and Laboratory Fees Fund. –\n\nThere is hereby established the radiation user and laboratory fees fund to be used to carry out the provisions of this chapter. The fund shall be composed of fees collected in accordance with RSA 125-F:8, IV. The fund shall be nonlapsing and shall be continually appropriated to the commissioner for the purposes of this chapter."
